# Story page: inferno
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = The Furnace
---
The Furnace is a place of walls and fire and purple doors that hum a tune only snakes can hear, which I am told is very catchy and very sad.

{name} discovered that being on fire makes you faster. It also discovered that this is not a healthy lesson, and that some lessons are best learned from books.

Golden scales lay scattered through the heat like breadcrumbs. Someone wished to be found, or else wished to be eaten. I did not volunteer to find out which.
